  "details": "Someone please explain this to me. The material changes on the walls are the same. But some work, some don't. If I swap working and not working materials, the working material still works in the new script, and vice versa. If I duplicate a working material, the duplicate doesn't work. The only thing I can think of is that the working materials were copied over from unity 2017.3.0, but other than that, everything is the same except color. Working examples come at the end in this video. https://youtu.be/eesEzyVaioc\nhttps://pastebin.com/EfXQkQGb\nI even gave the wall object stupid names to triple check I'm setting it on the right objects.",
